        "en": {
          "title": "B-1B Lancer clears design review for hypersonic missile",
          "summary": "Boeing says the pylon passed critical design review as the B-1B prepares to test the AGM-183A hypersonic missile.",
          "body": [
            "A US Air Force B‑1B Lancer was photographed in flight with what appears to be an AGM‑183A hypersonic missile mounted beneath its fuselage. The image first surfaced in April, although the exact flight date has not been confirmed.",
